# Serving checkpoints: the ones the app can select (covnext348.pth,
# swin-224px_final.pth, densenet-224px_final.pth) plus the two ConvNeXt-224
# members of `convnext_ensemble` are versioned via Git LFS (see .gitattributes),
# so a fresh clone works out of the box. Any further checkpoint file
# (re-downloaded, newly trained, temp) stays local-only unless explicitly added.
checkpoints/**/*.pth
!checkpoints/convnext-224px_final_numero1.pth
!checkpoints/convnext21k-224px_final.pth

